  "summary": "ATLANTA, June 25, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Gray Media has named Annie Cordell as the next General Manager of WMBF, the NBC affiliate serving Myrtle Beach and Florence, South Carolina effective July 13. Annie is a seasoned media executive with a distinguished career spanning broadcast television",
